---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy - OnlineResumATS" description="Our privacy policy. TL;DR: We don't collect, store, or transmit your resume data. Everything is processed locally in your browser.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-20">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-gray-500 mb-8">Last updated: June 2026</p>

    <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-xl p-6 mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-green-800 mb-2">TL;DR</h2>
      <p class="text-green-700">We don't collect, store, or transmit your resume data. All processing happens locally in your browser. We don't have user accounts or databases of resume content.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-600 space-y-6">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">1. Data Processing</h2>
      <p>OnlineResumATS processes all resume data, job descriptions, and generated content entirely within your web browser. No personal data from your resume is transmitted to our servers or any third-party service.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">2. What We Don't Collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Resume content or text</li>
        <li>Job descriptions you paste</li>
        <li>Generated cover letters</li>
        <li>Personal information (name, email, phone from your resume)</li>
        <li>Uploaded PDF files</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">3. What We May Collect</h2>
      <p>For basic site analytics and improvement, we may collect:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Anonymous page view counts</li>
        <li>Browser type and general location (country level)</li>
        <li>Which tools are used (not what content is processed)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">4. Cookies</h2>
      <p>We use minimal cookies only for basic site functionality and anonymous analytics. We do not use tracking cookies or advertising cookies that follow you across the web.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">5. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>We may use privacy-respecting analytics services. We do not sell or share any data with advertisers or data brokers.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">6. PDF Processing</h2>
      <p>When you upload a PDF, it is processed using pdf.js (Mozilla's open-source library) directly in your browser. The file is read into memory, parsed, and text is extracted — all on your device. The file is never uploaded to any server.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">7. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>Our service is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect information from children.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated date.</p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900">9. Contact</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about this privacy policy, please contact us at <a href="/contact" class="text-primary-600 hover:underline">our contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
